# .agentignore — file-level access restrictions for this project.
# The agent treats every pattern here exactly like the hardcoded patterns in
# ~/.config/opencode/AGENTS.md "Access Restrictions": never read or access
# without explicit user confirmation. Enforced mechanically by ~/.opencode-harness/scripts/dod.sh
# (staged files are checked against this list before every commit — see Step 8).
#
# NOTE: this is FILE-LEVEL only. It does NOT block field-level API reads
# (e.g. a Directus MCP call reading a PII field from an allowed collection).
# Field-level enforcement is not built yet — a dedicated MCP interceptor
# would be required for that.

# Production environment
.env.production
docker-compose.prod.yml

# Backups and dumps
backups/
dumps/
*.sql.gz

# Private keys
*.pem
*.key
